<title>BELGIUM: KB RAISES INVESTMENT CREDIT RATES.</title>
<headline>KB RAISES INVESTMENT CREDIT RATES.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian Kredietbank </p>
<p>said on Tuesday it would raise the base rates for its Belgian</p>
<p>franc investment credits from Wednesday, following a rise in</p>
<p>long-term interest rates and a similar move announced by</p>
<p>Belgium's other main banks.</p>
<p>    Maturity		   New rate     Old rate</p>
<p>    three-year revisable   5.70 pct     5.55 pct</p>
<p>    five-year revisable    6.60 pct     6.40 pct</p>
<p>    10-year revisable	7.75 pct     7.45 pct</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
